    "title": "LOL Surprise! OMG Fashion Club",
    "description": "Are you ready to conquer the fashion world? Play the fabulous dress up game LOL Surprise! OMG Fashion Club and become a style expert! Dive into the world of fashion games and let your creativity sparkle: collect clothes, put together unique outfits, and surprise yourself by doing every style makeover! So, are you ready to become a fashion stylist?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc57 <b>STYLE & EXPRESS YOURSELF</b>\r\nPlay trendy fashion games and experience the life of a stylist! Use your imagination and discover incredible outfit combos: find the best fashion matches and style the cutest looks! Create your avatar and style away! Play the game, do a fashion-forward makeover, and surprise the world with your sense of fashion!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf80 <b>PLAY FASHION MAKEOVER GAMES</b>\r\nHow well would you do in the fashion world? Get your glam on and play fashion games to find out! Give your style a makeover! Shop and match fancy items! Hurry up to catch as many clothes as you can in the game! Become a pro stylist, dress up, perform a makeover, and surprise your clients! Enjoy fashion games, level up your stylist skills with every makeover you do, and unlock new amazing areas to play makeover games in!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf8 <b>ENTER THE FASHION SHOW</b>\r\nStep into the fashion show area and create iconic looks for many marvelous events! Will your outfit stand out? Join an exciting fashion makeover competition and find out in the game! The best part is that you get to play a fashion judge! So start this dress up game and vote for your favorite fashion looks!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b>DO A MAKEOVER & BECOME THE TOP STYLIST</b>\r\nStyle looks and become the ultimate fashion games guru! Compete with others in dress up games and makeover quests, win lovely items, and find your way to the top spots on the stylist leaderboard! It\u2019s time to play fashion games and create magical outfits, so complete tasks and unlock fashion accessories!\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>CONQUER THE QUESTS</b